flowchart LR
  SRC[POS / web / loyalty / Odoo / supplier / payment]
  MAN[Source manifest: owner, hash, schema, watermark]
  LAND[Encrypted immutable landing / offline replay]
  VAL[Schema, type, key, totals validation]
  Q{Valid?}
  ERR[Quarantine with row and reason]
  STG[Staging with source IDs and batch ID]
  XW[Reference crosswalk and reviewed MDM]
  DIM[Load conformed dimensions; Type 2 history]
  FACT[Load idempotent facts]
  REC[Reconcile counts and control totals]
  BI[Masked semantic model and dashboard]
  SRC --> MAN --> LAND --> VAL --> Q
  Q -->|No| ERR
  Q -->|Yes| STG --> XW --> DIM --> FACT --> REC --> BI
  REC -->|Mismatch| ERR
